# Google service account keys. The private key in one of these grants whatever
# access the account has been given, to anyone holding the file, and it cannot
# be rotated without going back to the Cloud console. Keep them outside the
# repository entirely; these patterns are a backstop for when one is dropped in
# here to try something out and then forgotten.
*service-account*.json
*service_account*.json
*-credentials.json
*_credentials.json
secrets/
